$L += '<main><section class="hero"><div class="hero-content"><h1>Photo Gift Design Tips</h1><p>Turn your favorite memories into beautiful custom gifts</p></div></section>'
$L += '<div class="container"><article class="guide-content">'
$L += '<h2>Introduction to Photo Gifts</h2>'
$L += '<p>Photo gifts are among the most personal and meaningful custom items you can create. Whether it is a family portrait on a mug, a vacation snapshot on a blanket, or a candid moment on a pillow, photo gifts preserve memories in a tangible, everyday way.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Selecting the Right Photos</h2>'
$L += '<h3>Resolution and Quality</h3>'
$L += '<p>Always use the highest resolution photo available. Photos should be at least 300 DPI at the intended print size. Smartphone photos from modern cameras are usually sufficient, but avoid heavily cropped or zoomed images.</p>'
$L += '<h3>Lighting and Composition</h3>'
$L += '<p>Well-lit photos print better. Avoid dark, underexposed images. Photos with good contrast and clear subjects work best. Consider the background and ensure the main subject is clearly visible.</p>'
$L += '<h3>Photo Editing Tips</h2>'
$L += '<ul><li>Adjust brightness and contrast for better print results</li><li>Crop to focus on the main subject</li><li>Remove red-eye and minor blemishes</li><li>Apply subtle sharpening if the image appears soft</li><li>Avoid heavy filters that may look different when printed</li></ul>'
$L += '<h2>Design Layout Strategies</h2>'
$L += '<h3>Single Photo Design</h3>'
$L += '<p>One powerful photo can make a strong impact. Center the image and leave adequate margins. This works especially well for mugs, canvas prints, and single-image blankets.</p>'
$L += '<h3>Collage Design</h3>'
$L += '<p>Combine multiple photos into a cohesive layout. Use consistent spacing, choose a unifying color scheme, and vary photo sizes for visual interest. Collages work beautifully on blankets and pillows.</p>'
$L += '<h3>Photo with Text</h3>'
$L += '<p>Combine photos with meaningful text like dates, names, or quotes. Ensure text is readable against the background. Use contrasting colors for text overlays.</p>'
$L += '<h2>File Preparation</h2>'
$L += '<ul><li>Save as high-quality PNG or JPEG</li><li>Use sRGB color space for accurate color reproduction</li><li>Set resolution to at least 300 DPI at print size</li><li>Include bleed area if the design extends to edges</li><li>Remove any watermarks or copyrighted material</li></ul>'
$L += '<h2>Product-Specific Tips</h2>'
$L += '<h3>Photo Mugs</h3>'
$L += '<p>Use horizontal or square photos. Avoid placing important elements near the handle. Wraparound designs work well for panoramic photos.</p>'
$L += '<h3>Photo Blankets</h3>'
$L += '<p>Collages with 6-20 photos work beautifully. Leave space between photos for the fleece texture to show through. Use high-contrast images for best results.</p>'
$L += '<h3>Photo Pillows</h3>'
$L += '<p>Center the main subject. Remember that pillow edges will curve, so keep important elements away from borders. Square photos work best for square pillows.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Conclusion</h2>'
$L += '<p>Creating stunning photo gifts is easier than ever with these tips. By selecting quality photos, designing thoughtful layouts, and preparing files correctly, you can create personalized gifts that preserve your most cherished memories. Browse our <a href="../products/">photo gift collection</a> to get started.</p>'
$L += '</article></div></main>'
