$L += '<div class="container"><article class="guide-content">'
$L += '<h2>Introduction to Custom Home Decor</h2>'
$L += '<p>Personalized home decor transforms your living space into a reflection of who you are. Custom pillows, blankets, and wall art add unique character that mass-produced items simply cannot match.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Custom Pillows for Every Room</h2>'
$L += '<h3>Living Room</h3>'
$L += '<p>Create statement pillows that complement your existing decor. Choose colors that coordinate with your furniture. Consider family photos, inspirational quotes, or artistic patterns that set the tone for your space.</p>'
$L += '<h3>Bedroom</h3>'
$L += '<p>Personalized bedroom pillows add warmth and personality. Use soft, calming designs with meaningful photos or gentle patterns. Coordinate with your bedding for a cohesive look.</p>'
$L += '<h3>Kids Rooms</h3>'
$L += '<p>Custom pillows with names, favorite characters, or fun patterns make kids rooms special. Choose durable, washable fabrics that can handle active use.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Custom Blankets as Decor</h2>'
$L += '<p>Photo blankets are not just for warmth. Drape them over couch arms, foot of beds, or use them as decorative throws. Choose designs that complement your room color scheme.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Design Principles for Home Decor</h2>'
$L += '<h3>Color Harmony</h3>'
$L += '<p>Choose colors that work with your existing palette. Use complementary or analogous color schemes. Neutral backgrounds with colorful accents create balance.</p>'
$L += '<h3>Scale and Proportion</h3>'
$L += '<p>Consider the size of the item and where it will be displayed. Larger designs work on blankets, while smaller, detailed designs suit pillows. Ensure text is appropriately sized for the product.</p>'
$L += '<h3>Style Consistency</h3>'
$L += '<p>Maintain a consistent style throughout your custom decor collection. Mix and match designs that share common elements like colors, fonts, or themes.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Seasonal and Holiday Decor</h2>'
$L += '<p>Create custom decor for different seasons and holidays. Switch out pillows and blankets throughout the year to keep your space feeling fresh and festive.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Care and Maintenance</h2>'
$L += '<ul><li>Wash pillow covers in cold water on gentle cycle</li><li>Avoid direct sunlight to prevent fading</li><li>Rotate decorative items regularly for even wear</li><li>Store seasonal items in cool, dry places</li></ul>'
$L += '<h2>Conclusion</h2>'
$L += '<p>Custom home decor lets you create a living space that truly feels like home. By following these design principles and considering your existing decor style, you can create personalized pieces that are both beautiful and meaningful. Explore our <a href="../products/pillows.html">custom pillows</a> and <a href="../products/blankets.html">custom blankets</a> to start designing your personalized space.</p>'
